--- the built-in table
# built-in: the babywarmer bridge (3V3, 47k / 47k + 10k) and the
# MF58 10k B3950 datasheet curve, until the EEPROM has a calibration
bridge 3.3 47000 47000 10000
ntc 10000 25 3950
range -5 60
#= Beta curve through the bridge: R25 10000, T25 25.0 C, B 3950
#= valid -5.0 .. 60.0 C (codes -13216 .. 32544)
  1431 of 2048 entries calibrated
   -5.0 C = code  32549 -> code 32549 is outside the calibrated range (open or shorted?)
    0.0 C = code  25511 ->   0.00 C (+0.003)
   10.0 C = code  13189 ->  10.00 C (-0.005)
   25.0 C = code      0 ->  25.00 C (+0.000)
   30.0 C = code  -3105 ->  30.00 C (+0.002)
   35.0 C = code  -5687 ->  35.00 C (+0.000)
   36.5 C = code  -6371 ->  36.50 C (-0.002)
   37.0 C = code  -6590 ->  37.00 C (-0.004)
   40.0 C = code  -7822 ->  40.00 C (-0.001)
   50.0 C = code -11036 ->  49.99 C (-0.005)
   59.0 C = code -13038 ->  59.00 C (-0.001)
   62.0 C = code -13566 -> code -13566 is outside the calibrated range (open or shorted?)
  code 32767 (open NTC): code 32767 is outside the calibrated range (open or shorted?)
  code -32768 (shorted): code -32768 is outside the calibrated range (open or shorted?)
--- calibration, Steinhart-Hart through the bridge (a sensor with B 3900)
# 5 points, exact, real Beta 3900
bridge 3.3 47000 47000 10000
25118 0.0
0 25.0
-5625 35.0
-6521 37.0
-9497 45.0
